WEBVTT

00:00:00.454 --> 00:00:04.173
Shipping to QA and production.

00:00:04.173 --> 00:00:13.143
Dev has the console; QA and production do not.

00:00:13.143 --> 00:00:20.316
Build the QA bundle. A check runs automatically.

00:00:20.316 --> 00:00:24.992
And the production bundle.

00:00:24.992 --> 00:00:32.545
Confirm the developer console is not in the bundle.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:01:02.505
Start with start:qa or start:prod.
